[0.016091, "o", "\u001b[1mVejas — a signature, a behaviour, and a crash\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mTwo detect units read the same Sysmon subjects off one JetStream bus.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m── 1. Boot\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.491548, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m two units running: the Sigma-style rule and the behavioural sequence\r\n"]
[4.493694, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.493957, "o", "\u001b[1m── 2. A lazy attacker: PsExec, under its own name\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.494238, "o", "  \u001b[2m4 Sysmon events — PsExec spawns, connects to 10.0.0.10:445, cmd.exe appears under services.exe\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[20.418024, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m the signature fires: 1 alert(s) on vx.alerts.sigma\r\n"]
[20.41863, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m the behaviour fires too: 1 alert(s) on vx.alerts.lateral\r\n"]
[22.421086, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m── 3. The same attack, with the binary renamed to svcupdate.exe\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[22.421543, "o", "  \u001b[2mSame mechanism, different file name — the only thing a signature looks at\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[38.507655, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m \u001b[33mthe signature stays silent\u001b[0m — nothing is called PsExec any more\r\n"]
[38.507963, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m \u001b[32mthe behaviour catches it anyway\u001b[0m: 1 alert, T1021.002\r\n"]
[38.535684, "o", "      SMB lateral movement: remote service execution\r\n      svcupdate.exe → 10.0.0.10, then cmd.exe under services.exe on DC01\r\n"]
[40.542422, "o", "\r\n"]
[40.542602, "o", "\u001b[1m── 4. The crash, mid-sequence\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mPublish the SMB connection, kill -9 the runtime, restart it, publish the rest\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[42.461245, "o", "  \u001b[2mkilled at stream sequence 14; the open sequence lives only in the snapshot now\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[43.985872, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m the unit restored its snapshot and resumed after that sequence\r\n"]
[44.186585, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m \u001b[32mthe alert still arrives\u001b[0m — the half-finished sequence survived the kill\r\n"]
[44.187187, "o", "\r\n\u001b[32m\u001b[1mdetect demo: every beat holds ✓\u001b[0m\r\n"]
